{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40706","headline":"废寺闲居寄怀一二罢举知己 · 李洞","name":"废寺闲居寄怀一二罢举知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病居废庙冷吟烟，无力争飞类病蝉。\n槐省老郎蒙主弃，月陂孤客望谁怜。\n税房兼得调猿石，租地仍分浴鹤泉。\n处世堪惊又堪媿，一坡山色不论钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}